# Change the workout settings. Start the API with Aspire first, then send "Create an account" once.
@host = http://localhost:5279

### Create an account → 201. The requests below use its access token.
# @name createAccount
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Zagreb"
}

### Set the default rest time → 200 with the settings. Sound and vibrate stay on.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workout-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaultRestSeconds": 120
}

### Turn off the rest sound and vibrate → 200. The rest time stays the same.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workout-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restSound": false,
  "restVibrate": false
}

### Rest time off the 15 second steps → 400 validation, with an error for defaultRestSeconds.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workout-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaultRestSeconds": 70
}

### Not signed in → 401 unauthorized.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workout-settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaultRestSeconds": 60
}
